s10-6-p17 = prose (cons "Optimization may search among proved equivalent realizations using a cost model. The model itself is a function or relation over the relevant program and machine state. Instruction counts, cache behavior, bandwidth, and physical latency are different observations. The semantic theorem and the performance claim are therefore distinct typed statements about the same artifact. This keeps tensor compilation and performance engineering within the existing framework without pretending equality determines hardware timing." nil)
